  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "During bidding for Heavenly Gong Immortal Gu, Unfettered Scholar offers demon ferret skin Immortal Gu from a single room. He Lang Zi thinks that if one can gather demon ferret bone, demon ferret blood, and other related Immortal Gu, one can unleash heart demon ferret transformation. Transformation path killer moves are easy to form. Gathering a set of Immortal Gu is enough to form an immortal killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        751
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_heavenly_gong",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "char_unfettered_scholar",
        "char_he_lang_zi",
        "path_transformation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A heart demon ferret is a desolate beast. Wisdom path Gu worms are normally in its body. Demon ferret skin can provide resistance against wisdom path attacking methods. He Lang Zi already has three immortal wolf transformation killer moves. He notes that transforming into the heart demon ferret would be similar to a wolf form. He wants to develop fighting ability in water, so he does not bid for the skin Gu.",
